Phase 3 test-isolation fix

Replace only:
  xau-bot-core/tests/test_real_correlation_feed.py

Reason:
The old assertion inspected all of sys.modules, so it failed when another test
had already imported twisted or ctrader_open_api. The revised test blocks those
imports only while _build_correlation_feed() runs. It therefore tests whether
the code under test attempts an import, without depending on test execution order.

Verified in the supplied repository snapshot with the Phase 3 patch overlaid:
  pytest -q tests/test_real_correlation_feed.py -> 23 passed
  pytest -q -> 245 passed

No production code, trading logic, thresholds, risk settings, or cBot files changed.
